Current Dev Position: YP 4.2 M1

Next Deadline: 5th December 2022 YP 4.2 Build

 

Next Team Meetings:

*	Bug Triage meeting Thursday October 27th 7:30 am PDT (
<https://zoom.us/j/454367603?pwd=ZGxoa2ZXL3FkM3Y0bFd5aVpHVVZ6dz09>
https://zoom.us/j/454367603?pwd=ZGxoa2ZXL3FkM3Y0bFd5aVpHVVZ6dz09)
